idate B: conscientious, handles stress, but nasty remarks could be dangerous in crew environment.\n\nCandidate D: responsibility, problem solving, concentration, but hot temper and know-it-all could affect crew.\n\nCandidate A: technical and leadership but not open to new ideas, show-off could affect crew.\n\nWe need to start discussion, maybe propose Candidate B as leading due to reliability and stress, but note concerns about teamwork. Or propose Candidate C as leading due to decision quality and calmness, but note communication.\n\nWe need to state vote. Let's pick Candidate B as initial recommendation, because reliability and stress are critical, and we can discuss concerns later. Provide evidence: conscientious, handles stress, but note nasty remarks.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote.\n\nProceed."}
