ggest that we need to mitigate B's communication issues.\n\nThus our public message: \"I agree with the panel that B is currently the strongest, because we have concrete evidence of his reliability and stress handling, whereas A lacks any data on reliability or stress, and D only shows adequate stress resilience and has crew cooperation concerns. Therefore I maintain my vote for B, but we should discuss mitigation for his communication style.\"\n\nWe must include explicit facts: B is very conscientious, handles stress very well, makes nasty remarks; A has no explicit reliability or stress data; D responds to unexpected events adequately, is moody, loner, hot temper.\n\nNow produce final output."}
